  "id": "section-504-plan",
  "term": "Section 504 plan",
  "definition": "A Section 504 plan is a formal school accommodation plan used to support a student’s needs at school. In this source, it is described as one of the structured educational supports recommended for pediatric patients whose medical conditions may affect physical, cognitive, or developmental functioning.",
